# Operator UI and Analyzer

Operator-facing UI is in Romanian. TypeScript, Python, API, database, and contract names may stay in English.

Normal operator UI does not expose internal jargon: hashes, DTO names, raw codes, service names, compiler vocabulary, raw provenance, debug objects, or internal JSON. Those belong in later Development / Audit / Diagnostics views.

The operator should see what to complete, what is selected, what is missing, what to confirm, what is blocked and why, the result, and what comes next.

SVG Analyzer is a separate application. It may observe geometry and propose roles. It does not decide product, template, sold modules, commercial material, pricing, Product Truth, quote, order, or final execution tasks.

Analyzer output is evidence or proposal until an operator confirms it.
